## Screen layout

- 40 columns × 25 rows
- Screen RAM base: `$0400` (1024)
- Color RAM base: `$D800` (55296)
- Border color register: `$D020` / `VIC.bordercolor`
- Background color register: `$D021` / `VIC.bgcolor0`
- Common color values: 0=black, 1=white, 2=red, 5=green, 14=light blue

